---
title: AgentX Handoff Protocol — Envelope + R2 Data Plane
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Supervisor DO
    participant Q1 as Dispatch Queue
    participant A1 as Agent DO (Researcher)
    participant R2 as R2 Bucket
    participant Q2 as Result Queue
    participant G as Gate Evaluator
    participant A2 as Agent DO (Writer)

    Note over S: Pipeline run starts<br/>Supervisor reads DAG from KV

    S->>Q1: Dispatch task envelope<br/>{agent: researcher, input_ref: r2://...}
    Q1->>A1: Deliver task message

    Note over A1: Agent pulls input from R2<br/>Executes LLM call<br/>Owns its own SQLite memory

    A1->>R2: Write output artifact<br/>r2://run-123/researcher/output.json
    A1->>Q2: Completion envelope<br/>{artifact_ref: r2://..., tokens: 4200, model: sonnet}

    Q2->>S: Deliver completion event
    S->>G: Evaluate gate conditions

    alt Gate passes
        G->>S: PASS: all checks clear
        Note over S: Update DAG state<br/>Dispatch next agent

        S->>Q1: Dispatch to writer<br/>{agent: writer, input_refs: [r2://researcher/...]}
        Q1->>A2: Deliver task message
        A2->>R2: Pull upstream artifact(s)

        Note over A2: Agent reads parent artifacts<br/>via context_window.parent_refs<br/>Executes LLM call

        A2->>R2: Write final output
        A2->>Q2: Completion envelope
        Q2->>S: Pipeline complete
    else Gate fails
        G->>S: FAIL: hallucination detected
        Note over S: Recovery engine activates

        alt Retry available
            S->>Q1: Re-dispatch to researcher<br/>with adjusted prompt
        else Retries exhausted
            S->>Q1: Dispatch to fallback agent
        else No fallback
            S-->>S: Escalate to human<br/>via notification
        end
    end
